  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Junior Professional Officers to WFP 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the Junior Professional Officer (JPO) Programme is to utilize the talent and energy of young professions to assist in the prompt delivery and distribution of relief and humanitarian food assistance, and to provide an environment whereby the JPOs gain experience and knowledge in the world of international humanitarian assistance. To this end, JPOs will be utilized in different capacities, and will be assigned to jobs which are liked to a programme or a project in the field which is representative of the work of WFP.</narrative>
  </description>
